            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這不是 GitHub 地址。請使用 https://github.com/<所有者>/<倉庫>"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eso no es una dirección de GitHub. Usa https://github.com/<propietario>/<repo>"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce n'est pas une adresse GitHub. Utilisez https://github.com/<propriétaire>/<dépôt>"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Assistant tab is an offline, rule-based coach. Ask ChatGPT opens ChatGPT with text you review. PocketTrainer itself never goes online except when you import from GitHub.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“助手”页是离线的、基于规则的教练。“Ask ChatGPT”会用你检查过的文字打开 ChatGPT。除了从 GitHub 导入，PocketTrainer 本身从不联网。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“助手”頁是離線的、基於規則的教練。“Ask ChatGPT”會用你檢查過的文字開啟 ChatGPT。除了從 GitHub 匯入，PocketTrainer 本身從不聯網。"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La pestaña Asistente es un entrenador sin conexión basado en reglas. Ask ChatGPT abre ChatGPT con un texto que tú revisas. PocketTrainer nunca se conecta a internet, salvo al importar desde GitHub."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L'onglet Assistant est un coach hors ligne à base de règles. Ask ChatGPT ouvre ChatGPT avec un texte que vous relisez. PocketTrainer ne se connecte jamais, sauf pour importer depuis GitHub."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The app closes itself in the middle of training; open it again and it continues from the last checkpoint (needs \"Save checkpoints\" in Settings).": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "App 会在训练中途自己关闭；再次打开后会从上一个存档继续（需要在设置里打开“保存存档”）。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "App 會在訓練中途自己關閉；再次開啟後會從上一個存檔繼續（需要在設定裡開啟“儲存存檔”）。"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La app se cierra sola a mitad del entrenamiento; vuelve a abrirla y continúa desde el último punto de control (requiere «Guardar puntos de control» en Ajustes)."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L'app se ferme d'elle-même en plein entraînement ; rouvrez-la et elle reprend au dernier point de contrôle (nécessite « Enregistrer les points de contrôle » dans Réglages)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The import record is missing or damaged.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "导入记录丢失或已损坏。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "匯入記錄丟失或已損壞。"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El registro de importación falta o está dañado."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le journal d'import est manquant ou endommagé."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The interruption silently ruined the unprotected run on this phone.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在这部手机上，打断悄悄毁掉了没有保护的那次训练。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在這部手機上，打斷悄悄毀掉了沒有保護的那次訓練。"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "En este teléfono la interrupción arruinó en silencio la ejecución sin protección."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sur ce téléphone, l'interruption a ruiné en silence l'exécution non protégée."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The last training did not finish. It can continue from its saved checkpoint.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "上一次训练没有完成。可以从它保存的存档继续。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "上一次訓練沒有完成。可以從它儲存的存檔繼續。"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El último entrenamiento no terminó. Puede continuar desde su punto de control guardado."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le dernier entraînement n'est pas terminé. Il peut reprendre depuis son point de contrôle enregistré."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The loss barely went down. Try a bigger learning rate, for example %@.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "损失几乎没有下降。试试更大的学习率，例如 %@。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "損失幾乎沒有下降。試試更大的學習率，例如 %@。"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La pérdida casi no bajó. Prueba una tasa de aprendizaje mayor, por ejemplo %@."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La perte a à peine baissé. Essayez un taux d'apprentissage plus grand, par exemple %@."
